en:
The TAC30 offers a very wide field of view, and 1x magnification at the lower end - making for easy, fast target acquisition. The 4x full zoom and Ballistic CQ reticle make shots out to about 300 yards very practical. The illuminated center dot and large, bright circle allow for instant target engagement at close distances.  

^orange;+30% [EWS] Hit Chance and Accuracy when stationary.^reset;
^red;-40% [EWS] Hit Chance and Accuracy when moving.^reset;

^green;Right-click on a compatible GiC Weapon to attach.^reset;

ko:
TAC30은 매우 넓은 시야와 최하단 1x 배율을 제공해 쉽고 빠른 표적 획득이 가능하다. 4x 완전 줌과 Ballistic CQ 레티클로 약 300야드까지의 사격이 매우 실용적이다. 조명 중앙점과 크고 밝은 원으로 근거리 즉각 교전이 가능하다.  

^orange;+30% [EWS] 적중 확률과 명중률(정지 시).^reset;
^red;-40% [EWS] 적중 확률과 명중률(이동 시).^reset;

^green;호환되는 GiC 무기를 우클릭해 장착.^reset;

en:
the Trijicon ACOG TA01NSN is Trijicon’s most popular ACOG. The ranging reticle allows for bullet drop compensation out to 600 meters without any manual adjustments. The reticle will appear black during the daytime and will glow amber in the dark, thanks to Trijicon’s patented tritium illumination. No batteries needed!

^orange;+20% [EWS] Hit Chance and Accuracy when stationary.^reset;
^red;-20% [EWS] Hit Chance and Accuracy when moving.^reset;

^green;Right-click on a compatible GiC Weapon to attach.^reset;

ko:
