ATN’s X-Sight 4K Pro has been a firm favourite for some time, and comes with 5-20x and 3-14x magnification options, the latter offering a slightly wider field of view.

^#96CBE7;Highlights targets in a 30-degree angle from the gun | 120 Block Range | Cannot see through walls.^reset;

