2 MOA red dot for precision and fast target acquisition. Advanced optical lenses for enhanced light transmission and ultimate dot clarity.

^green;+20% accuracy.^reset;
^yellow;Does not improve hit chance.^reset;

^green;Right-click on a compatible GiC Weapon to attach.^reset;

ko:
정밀과 빠른 표적 획득을 위한 2 MOA 레드닷. 향상된 광 투과율과 궁극의 점 선명도를 위한 고급 광학 렌즈.

^green;+20% 정확도.^reset;
